<title>NETHERLANDS: EMU membersnip may be easier now for Italy -Prodi.</title>
<headline>EMU membersnip may be easier now for Italy -Prodi.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Prime Minister romano Prodi said the European Union summit on Monday might have boosted Italy's chances of joining Europe's single currency from the start.</p>
<p>&quot;I have always been confident Italy would be in the first wave. Now it may be easier. But I was confident yesterday,&quot; he told reporters.</p>
</text>
